
From: AX23 v2 port maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommax: ipq50xx: add Archer AX23 v2 network defaults

Add the DSA LAN and WAN interface roles for the Archer AX23 v2.
The DTS labels the four LAN switch ports lan1 through lan4
and the WAN port wan.

---
 target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network b/target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network
--- a/target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network
@@ -11,5 +11,6 @@ ipq50xx_setup_interfaces()
 	linksys,mr2000|\
 	linksys,mr5500|\
+	tplink,archer-ax23-v2|\
 	tplink,archer-ax55-v1|\
 	zyxel,scr50axe)
 		ucidef_set_interfaces_lan_wan "lan1 lan2 lan3 lan4" "wan"
